sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant Inertia as Inertia client
  participant Laravel as Laravel route/controller
  participant Vue as Vue page resolver
  participant Component as Page components
  Browser->>Inertia: Navigate or submit form
  Inertia->>Laravel: Web request with session/CSRF context
  Laravel-->>Inertia: Inertia page payload or redirect
  Inertia->>Vue: Resolve component name and props
  Vue->>Component: Render page/layout/shared UI
  Component-->>Browser: Update DOM and interaction state
  Browser->>Inertia: Next navigation or form request
